            "label": "사사문구",
            "value": "국문 - 본 연구는 산업통상자원부와 한국산업기술진흥원의 “지역혁신클러스터육성(R&D, P0025377)”사업의 지원을 받아 수행된 연구결과임.\n영문 - This research was financially supported by the Ministry of Trade, Industry and Energy, Korea, under the “Regional Innovation Cluster Development Program(R&D, P0025377)” supervised by the Korea Institute for Advancement of Technology(KIAT)."
